{
    "title": "TicketSwap - Buy, Sell Tickets",
    "description": "TicketSwap is the safest way to buy and sell tickets for all types of events! Download our app and start buying and selling tickets for concerts, festivals, gigs, clubs, theatres and other events.\r\n\r\nNo hidden fees. No unfair prices. TicketSwap checks the prices of the tickets and verifies sellers and buyers to ensure safe and fair transactions. \r\n\r\nOur transparent marketplace is the best way for real fans to find tickets to sold out concerts, festivals or any other event. \r\n\r\nJoin a community of 8 million fans from all over the world!\r\n\r\nTop reasons to download TicketSwap:\r\n \r\n* Simple and easy: Buy and sell tickets in just a few seconds. \r\n* Our SecureSwap\u2122 technology, and our partnerships with event organizers, helps us to prevent fraud.\r\n* Browse our curated list of events\r\n* Search for concerts, festivals, clubs, venues and cities\r\n* Creating a listing to sell your ticket is free. (TicketSwap charges a fee after the ticket is bought.)\r\n* Be the first to know when new tickets are available. Subscribe to Ticket Alerts to get notified.\r\n* Access your tickets (even offline) as soon as they are available\r\n* Create an account with Facebook or just an email\r\n* Use all major debit & credit cards\r\n* Live Support: Our customer support team is available to help you at every step.\r\n_______________________\r\n\r\nDownload the app today and share your experiences with everyone! TicketSwap is here to ensure you'll have the best ticket buying and selling experience. \r\n\r\n_______________________\r\n\r\nWe\u2019d love to hear your thoughts and ideas! \r\nPlease share them with us via info@ticketswap.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "TicketSwap is the safest way to buy and sell tickets for all types of events! Download our app and start buying and selling tickets for concerts, festivals, gigs, clubs, theatres and other events.<br><br>No hidden fees. No unfair prices. TicketSwap checks the prices of the tickets and verifies sellers and buyers to ensure safe and fair transactions. <br><br>Our transparent marketplace is the best way for real fans to find tickets to sold out concerts, festivals or any other event. <br><br>Join a community of 8 million fans from all over the world!<br><br>Top reasons to download TicketSwap:<br> <br>* Simple and easy: Buy and sell tickets in just a few seconds. <br>* Our SecureSwap\u2122 technology, and our partnerships with event organizers, helps us to prevent fraud.<br>* Browse our curated list of events<br>* Search for concerts, festivals, clubs, venues and cities<br>* Creating a listing to sell your ticket is free. (TicketSwap charges a fee after the ticket is bought.)<br>* Be the first to know when new tickets are available. Subscribe to Ticket Alerts to get notified.<br>* Access your tickets (even offline) as soon as they are available<br>* Create an account with Facebook or just an email<br>* Use all major debit &amp; credit cards<br>* Live Support: Our customer support team is available to help you at every step.<br>_______________________<br><br>Download the app today and share your experiences with everyone! TicketSwap is here to ensure you&#39;ll have the best ticket buying and selling experience. <br><br>_______________________<br><br>We\u2019d love to hear your thoughts and ideas! <br>Please share them with us via info@ticketswap.com",
